From b75cb3cc38d6ef3a7a3b16cfe4d80ff12b6f5a6f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Z User <z@container>
Date: Thu, 2 Apr 2026 15:07:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix: resolve 30 critical bugs, security issues, and Saudi
 localization
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Critical Fixes:
- Fix password hashing mismatch (SHA-256 → bcrypt) in seed and change-password
- Fix role case mismatch ('developer' → 'DEVELOPER') in 9 API routes
- Fix status 'approved' → 'available' so approved apartments appear in listings
- Remove hardcoded credentials from seed endpoint response
- Remove non-existent Prisma fields (featuredUntil, featured)

Security Fixes:
- Add JWT auth to comments API (prevent client-controlled developer flag)
- Add JWT auth to messages, likes, inquiries, payments, edit-requests APIs
- Add JWT auth to upload, logs, seed APIs
- Add JWT auth to duplicate /api/[id] routes (PUT/DELETE)
- Add DEVELOPER role verification to all admin endpoints

Frontend Fixes:
- Change Egyptian areas to Saudi cities (16 cities)
- Change currency from ج.م to ر.س (18 occurrences)
- Add 'تواصل معنا' button to mobile menu
- Fix developer login not setting currentUser state

